      "content": "probably a kind of knife (note E122/194/24 Prage cultelli; despite the definitions offered by the OED, this must be some sort of knife); possibly prag, a pin, nail or spike (OED s.v. prage); or prog, a piercing instrument or weapon, a spike, skewer (OED s.v. prog); or brog, a pricking or boring instrument (OED s.v. brog)"
